ls such as Claude Code,", "start": 49.02, "end": 52.44}, {"text": "Codex, GitHub Copilot, and more built in.", "start": 52.44, "end": 55.82}, {"text": "As they work with AI to solve problems,", "start": 55.82, "end": 58.8}, {"text": "VibeLevel looks beyond the final result", "start": 58.8, "end": 60.84}, {"text": "to understand how they approach the task.", "start": 60.84, "end": 63.23}, {"text": "Core Skills reveals how candidates perform", "start": 64.15, "end": 66.89}, {"text": "against role-specific competencies.", "start": 66.89, "end": 69.51}, {"text": "Working with AI evaluates how they guide AI,", "start": 69.51, "end": 72.53}, {"text": "make decisions, and verify its output.", "start": 72.53, "end": 75.06}, {"text": "Ownership and Human Contribution reveal", "start": 75.83, "end": 78.37}, {"text": "the responsibility candidates take", "start": 78.37, "end": 80.39}, {"text": "and the value they bring beyond AI-generated output.", "start": 80.39, "end": 84.49}, {"text": "The assessment report brings together skill scores,", "start": 84.49, "end": 87.31}, {"text": "AI collaboration insights, Code Review,", "start": 87.31, "end": 90.29}, {"text": "and Video Q&A.", "start": 90.29, "end": 91.79}, {"text": "The Interview Guide turns strengths", "start": 91.79, "end": 93.61}, {"text": "and gaps into focused follow-up questions.", "start": 93.61, "end": 96}], "musicOffset": 4.5, "muteVoice": true}